<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has renewed a rare torture indictment against Maduro for ordering torture of rivals and has deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela while also pressing India’s Reliance to refine Venezuelan oil to offset the Iran crisis. Trump has claimed that U.S. forces captured Maduro and his wife and warned that Cuba is next after recent attacks on Venezuela and Iran. Opposition groups are organising nationwide protests demanding elections and the return of Machado, and a Dutch security report warns that Venezuela’s instability could threaten Curaçao and the wider Caribbean Kingdom. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxObzByT2NGVXJRM1dyM0o2Nm4zNVBualdTWkpKM2NuRm9VUXNQSVhTb3dMY2d0SnpJZFJqeU1sTlZCcTVLX3B0M1V5TjAtNDVGMGdaU0xRbU9zYUFZN2xQM2dFczBVSFNSR01qUkhHXzdpSC14RmdrdW5DajJrZFRJTWZia3puU29rRDV4dzB3a2V3YWJjbUlqWXlRY0Z5Q0hTb3hGZVVzbGRUb3VLZHM5dzdDZlc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQbzBMMDdPZF9wYUs1eXd4TFNvTzI0OGtqN1VQTjVuOGJMYmVveEpveEhoY2NpbV9LZUhrWXJLRWV4ODN2ZkJ3RGI1MFYxM0pmMGNlX05OSjdjTlNLUjU0VDVlbzljaWNXVjlYVVFLUlNXaGJ1TXVJRjBHam93V1E1MThWTHNQS2lrVFpYcF84VndXaXhLU3Yzam9nVnJDeGdzN0JXZkhiUXlZZ1hIN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;HOLA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5sck9vVkpHeEdzckNhRDBYWnJmbEppOU9SY1NmS09renRTRmU5QXlBelRuQ0RPeUNsd0lnNFZOX2R5MEZibkJzSjVfMWNRMC1wVzJNRTExLVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;CubaHeadlines&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1KZUJNSXFmNWtvZ3BxNDVQeWhPZHcxZlp4cWdaQVBsdG1uODV0RXh4SHV6QnJsU21OZnUyeEkwVm1Udlk0b2tBcXBrdzZZN2wyenZXbGFQNTM?